 185+ 64A1 32 BF 82         LD (CurrentObjective), A
 186+ 64A4 CD 85 F0         CALL ResolveObjectiveScreen
 187+ 64A7 3E FF            LD A, $FF
 188+ 64A9 32 C2 82         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A
 189+ 64AC C9               RET
