 547+ 6646 DD 23            INC IX                                  ; -> pixel data
 548+ 6648                  ; Shift = E & 7 ; aligned X = E & ~7
 549+ 6648 7B               LD A, E
 550+ 6649 E6 07            AND $07
 551+ 664B 32 A5 66         LD (.dbsShift), A
 552+ 664E 7B               LD A, E
 553+ 664F E6 F8            AND $F8
