 471+ 8FA8 FE 05            CP STATE_SCARED
 472+ 8FAA 20 0B            JR NZ, .dsmNext
 473+ 8FAC CD 58 8F         CALL WipeMonsterSlot
 474+ 8FAF DD 36 01 00      LD (IX+ENT_TYPE), TYPE_NONE
 475+ 8FB3 DD 36 02 00      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_IDLE
