7489+ C8DE 4F               LD C, A                             ; C = newDepth
7490+ C8DF 23               INC HL
7491+ C8E0 22 6D 5F         LD (DBfsQTail), HL
7492+ C8E3                  ; --- Score: max depth tie-break min manhattan ---
