 224+ E4E7                  ; --- Tecla N: togglea NoclipMode (debug) ---
 225+ E4E7 3E 7F            LD A, $7F
 226+ E4E9 DB FE            IN A, ($FE)                 ; fila SPACE-SS-M-N-B
 227+ E4EB CB 5F            BIT 3, A                    ; N = bit 3 (0 = pulsada)
 228+ E4ED 20 13            JR NZ, .nNotPressed
 229+ E4EF 3A 08 E5         LD A, (NoclipKeyDebounce)
 230+ E4F2 B7               OR A
