1407+ F5AB 29               ADD HL, HL
1408+ F5AC 29               ADD HL, HL
1409+ F5AD 11 A3 81         LD DE, EntityTable
1410+ F5B0 19               ADD HL, DE
1411+ F5B1 E5               PUSH HL
