 171+ EB03                  ; --- Skip compass si lasting permanent ---
 172+ EB03 21 CD 82         LD HL, MagicCompassPermanent
 173+ EB06 CB 46            BIT 0, (HL)
 174+ EB08 28 04            JR Z, .grpiPicked
 175+ EB0A FE 07            CP ROUL_COMPASS
 176+ EB0C 28 E3            JR Z, .grpiPick                         ; compass + permanent -> re-pica
 177+ EB0E
 178+ EB0E              .grpiPicked:
 179+ EB0E 32 E0 5F         LD (RouletteDisplayedType), A           ; persistir para dispatcher al recoger
