 568+ ECB9 22 DA 5F         LD (EspadaTimer), HL
 569+ ECBC 21 00 00         LD HL, 0
 570+ ECBF 22 E2 82         LD (MushroomLockTimer), HL          ; antagonista last wins
 571+ ECC2 C9               RET
